    "message": "wp1039 r1: RUNBOOK A0.4e — cong thuc doi khoa bundle agent dung voi hanh vi agent-creds-set\n\nFinding P2 cua Codex connector tren 901644d (discussion_r4431827772): `agent-creds-set` khong\n`--new` giai ma ban cu bang TL_MASTER_KEY hien tai (scripts/tl_gws.py cmd_agent_creds_set) =>\nsau khi doi khoa tra rc 3, 0 upload. Cong thuc dung: dat khoa moi, `agent-creds-set --new ...`\ntao bundle MOI, bat anyone-with-link, dat TL_AGENT_CREDS_FILEID=<fileId moi> cung TL_MASTER_KEY\nmoi o ca hai nen (bootstrap va agent-creds-exec deu doc TL_AGENT_CREDS_FILEID truoc hang).\nTai sinh RELEASE_MANIFEST.json (RUNBOOK nam trong manifest). Giu tran +700.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrbVWthHq1mtsPgqZLw",
